391", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cNWiP1-fKNQQ7kNvwFPXOQb&_nc_oc=AdrMwFv_8ktaWbfYXiEGW5Xu4hlkWS40mL45RwTTGeKVKV9ViJo-gBXG09uCAIoZ5zM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLmHjsX8WKJMteApIub8LvsDFcyALKBFz2X-YfSKE_Wyw&oe=6ABBC911"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sdku0KUrFR4Q7kNvwEnQkWm&_nc_oc=Ado20tDoSzUCLpVRBeYv4Bd3P8g2rqAm1gIRzwsai0m6vTv5hBFF3KTY4BAvC7TJP7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKX8po1lUfxsZa8Sd9QMjnKWllFhOuWVfnmZjOeiE8big&oe=6ABBD0DD"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=avqHrrJytWEQ7kNvwHhLisF&_nc_oc=AdrbOzGtKJmAhgO-7Urq1MuSkntB20DgQcvorBCxCFsjGH4N7HNTZ51feJf9MpIOUhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZ5htb26_Ic_S6aGBSRiJCZiHqYKfDAiM9GfIUynoSRg&oe=6ABBC3B9"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PmT8QjnvZwUQ7kNvwEVWaSJ&_nc_oc=AdrrTznEOXZmyYpd3ZwPe_y-39jdJ0vM4OhDIFjpbkjhxOYs7EndTQJODil4Sfx83a0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZx1K7S79W48X7vjrxCczzYM5oIJOGegF328_BvcFmow&oe=6ABBB20A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VaTwWIOHazAQ7kNvwGtBpMs&_nc_oc=AdqrsmU1kqEFM4YP2F0VIwYIH3mqzfH2xxwX-94g3DsM89eZUnRohpEhc6m7avFoHNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbq-zhqxZ-xTjAa29zqo3sUMxAQwS41rpGPTimiWgYQA&oe=6ABBB2DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "37